SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEWEB:https://www.jessejackjones.com

###Block: Epic Ki Feats

Absolute Ki Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=29	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Improved Ki Strike	DESC:Your unarmed strikes are treated as epic and adamantine for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.71
Channel Positive Ki	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	DESC:You can spend ki points to channel positive energy as a cleric of your monk level.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.71
Font of Ki	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	DESC:Your ki pool increases by 4.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.71
Hardened Aura	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	DESC:You gain spell resistance equal to your monk level + 10. If you already have SR, it increases by 5.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.71
Improved Ki Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	DESC:Your unarmed strikes deal an additional 1d6 points of damage. This damage is not multiplied on a critical hit.	STACK:YES	MULT:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.71
Keen Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:Your unarmed strikes have a critical threat range of 18-20.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Ki Armor	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:You can spend 1 ki point as a swift action to gain a +4 armor bonus to AC for 1 minute.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Ki Blast	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	DESC:You can spend 2 ki points to fire a ranged touch attack blast of ki energy dealing damage equal to your unarmed strike damage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Ki Bomb	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Ki Blast	DESC:You can spend 3 ki points to create a ki bomb that explodes in a 20-foot radius, dealing your unarmed strike damage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Ki Wave	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=FEAT,Ki Blast	DESC:You can spend 3 ki points to create a 60-foot line of ki energy dealing your unarmed strike damage.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Lion's Roar	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,CHA=23	DESC:You can spend 2 ki points to release a powerful shout that deals sonic damage and deafens creatures in a 30-foot cone.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.72
Nirvana	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=31	DESC:You achieve a state of perfect enlightenment, gaining immunity to all mind-affecting effects and the ability to meditate to recover ki at an accelerated rate.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.73
Poison Ki	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=23	DESC:You can spend 1 ki point to add a debilitating poison effect to your unarmed strikes for 1 round.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.73
Shattering Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,STR=25	DESC:Your unarmed strikes ignore hardness of objects and deal full damage to constructs.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.73
Transfixing Strike	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=25	DESC:You can spend 2 ki points to paralyze a creature struck by your unarmed attack (Fort save negates, DC 10 + 1/2 level + Wis modifier).	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.73
Zen Focus	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:Epic.Ki	PRESTAT:1,WIS=27	DESC:While maintaining a state of focus, you gain a +2 insight bonus to AC, attack rolls, and saving throws. Maintaining focus requires a move action each round.	SOURCELONG:Epic Pathfinder Handbook v1.6	SOURCESHORT:EPH	SOURCEPAGE:p.73
